  # More CEOs envision hiring than firing due to AI, CEO survey finds
  
  ![](https://www.axios.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.axios.com%2F3PMS6v3KbO96yLnrKHs2MwtBOgc%3D%2F52x0%2Fsmart%2F2023%2F07%2F28%2F1690562912699.jpg&w=128&q=75)
  
