Why these startup CEOs don't think AI will replace human roles
  URL: https://finance.yahoo.com/news/why-startup-ceos-don-t-204722135.html
  Abdullah Asiri, founder of AI-powered consumer support tooling startup Lucidya, said that he believes that AI will replace tasks but not roles.

