  # CEO replaces entire QA team with AI to cut costs. Techie reveals what happened next: 'We lost $6 million.....'
  
  SECTIONS
  
  CEO replaces entire QA team with AI to cut costs. Techie reveals what happened next: 'We lost $6 million.....'
  
