  Synopsis
  
  A company's decision to eliminate its quality assurance division and replace it with an AI-driven testing system backfired spectacularly. A malfunction led to a massive financial loss, prompting the CEO to controversially seek unpaid help from a recently laid-off employee. This incident highlights the risks of overreliance on automation without human oversight.
  
